# =========================================================
# RANK 1 - "After the bell"
# GATE: char son_1, rank 1, period afternoon, room classroom
# =========================================================

~ start

$> locals.tone = 0
$> GameState.location("Classroom · After the bell")
$> GameState.sprite("son_1", "desk")

The room empties in about ninety seconds. He doesn't move.

Miles: [#mood=averted, #pose=desk] You don't have to wait.

Mom: [#mood=neutral, #pose=standing] I'm not waiting. I have marking.

Miles: [#mood=averted] Right.

He doesn't believe her. He's right not to.

She sits down at the desk next to his and pulls the pile over.

Miles: [#mood=neutral] Worksheet four.

Mom: [#mood=neutral] Worksheet four.

Miles: [#mood=averted] I got question seven wrong. On purpose, maybe.

Mom: [#mood=surprised] On purpose.

Miles: [#mood=averted] So you'd have something to say to me.

He says it like it's nothing. Then goes very red.

- "That's a lot of work for a conversation."
$> locals.tone += 1
Mom: [#mood=soft] That's a lot of work for a conversation.
Miles: [#mood=flushed] It's not. It's one question.
Mom: [#mood=soft] It's one question a week for a term.
Miles: [#mood=flushed] ...Yeah.
- "You could just say hello."
Mom: [#mood=neutral] You could just say hello.
Miles: [#mood=averted] Hello is harder.
- Say nothing and mark.
Mom: [#mood=neutral] Mm.
She marks. He watches her mark.

He's got his hand on the mouse, not using it. The screen's asleep.

Miles: [#mood=averted] You're the only one who calls on me.

Mom: [#mood=surprised] I call on everyone.

Miles: [#mood=averted] You call on everyone else twice.

She has no answer for that, so she keeps marking.

The clock in the corridor does the loud thing it does at ten past four.

Miles: [#mood=soft] Same time Thursday?

Mom: [#mood=soft] Same time Thursday.

He leaves first. She waits until she can't hear his shoes, then looks up.

if locals.tone >= 2
$> GameState.apply("miles_r1_bonus")
else
$> GameState.apply("miles_r1")

$> GameState.rank_card("son_1", 1)

=> END


